<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="the last one remains"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="紫咲ほたる"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="RD-Sounds"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="凋叶棕"/><amll:meta key="album" value="契"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3383662098"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="003PNhSJ47PdGQ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="52458173"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="NereaFantasia"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:55.946"><div begin="19.548" end="4:55.946"><p begin="19.548" end="29.367" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.548" end="19.670">も</span><span begin="19.670" end="19.984">っ</span><span begin="19.984" end="20.475">と</span><span begin="20.475" end="20.693">も</span><span begin="20.693" end="21.361">永</span><span begin="21.361" end="21.922">く</span><span begin="21.922" end="22.722">悠</span><span begin="22.722" end="23.352">久</span><span begin="23.352" end="23.746">に</span><span begin="23.746" end="24.268">永</span><span begin="24.268" end="24.825">く</span><span begin="24.825" end="25.643">遺</span><span begin="25.643" end="26.237">る</span><span begin="26.237" end="27.032">伝</span><span begin="27.032" end="27.510">言</span><span begin="27.510" end="27.673">こ</span><span begin="27.673" end="28.025">そ</span><span begin="28.025" end="29.367">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最为久远 在悠久中最为久远 所留存的传言——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mottomo nagaku yuukyuu ni nagaku nokoru tsutaegoto koso wa</span></p><p begin="30.911" end="40.255" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.911" end="31.833">人</span><span begin="31.833" end="31.940">の</span><span begin="31.940" end="32.758">記</span><span begin="32.758" end="33.309">憶</span><span begin="33.309" end="33.661">に</span><span begin="33.661" end="34.776">神</span><span begin="34.776" end="35.128">の</span><span begin="35.128" end="35.649">記</span><span begin="35.649" end="36.212">憶</span><span begin="36.212" end="36.564">に</span><span begin="36.564" end="37.116">途</span><span begin="37.116" end="37.667">絶</span><span begin="37.667" end="37.933">え</span><span begin="37.933" end="38.097">て</span><span begin="38.097" end="38.467">も</span><span begin="38.467" end="38.891">な</span><span begin="38.891" end="39.054">お</span><span begin="39.054" end="39.188">久</span><span begin="39.188" end="39.340">し</span><span begin="39.340" end="40.255">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在人的记忆中 在神的记忆中 纵已断绝仍然悠远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hito no kioku ni kami no kioku ni todaete mo nao hisashii</span></p><p begin="42.330" end="52.222" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.330" end="43.045">そ</span><span begin="43.045" end="43.718">の</span><span begin="43.718" end="45.190">石</span><span begin="45.190" end="47.240">塊</span><span begin="47.240" end="47.573">刻</span><span begin="47.573" end="47.725">ん</span><span begin="47.725" end="48.107">だ</span><span begin="48.107" end="49.313">永</span><span begin="49.313" end="50.113">遠</span><span begin="50.113" end="50.786">の</span><span begin="50.786" end="51.537">睦</span><span begin="51.537" end="52.222">言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那石块上 所铭刻的 永恒的絮语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono ishikure kizanda eien no mutsugoto</span></p><p begin="53.701" end="1:03.080" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.701" end="54.775">思</span><span begin="54.775" end="54.905">え</span><span begin="54.905" end="55.214">ば</span><span begin="55.214" end="56.161">幾</span><span begin="56.161" end="56.533">度</span><span begin="56.533" end="57.589">選</span><span begin="57.589" end="57.755">ば</span><span begin="57.755" end="57.977">れ</span><span begin="57.977" end="58.440">ず</span><span begin="58.440" end="59.026">に</span><span begin="59.026" end="59.406">置</span><span begin="59.406" end="59.869">い</span><span begin="59.869" end="1:00.422">て</span><span begin="1:00.422" end="1:00.650">ゆ</span><span begin="1:00.650" end="1:00.841">か</span><span begin="1:00.841" end="1:01.208">れ</span><span begin="1:01.208" end="1:01.356">た</span><span begin="1:01.356" end="1:01.740">こ</span><span begin="1:01.740" end="1:01.902">と</span><span begin="1:01.902" end="1:02.050">だ</span><span begin="1:02.050" end="1:02.229">ろ</span><span begin="1:02.229" end="1:03.080">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想来 有过多少次未被选中 就那样被留下了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">omoeba ikudo erabarezuni oiteyukareta koto darou</span></p><p begin="1:04.449" end="1:15.895" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.449" end="1:04.754">路</span><span begin="1:04.754" end="1:04.964">傍</span><span begin="1:04.964" end="1:05.129">の</span><span begin="1:05.129" end="1:06.543">石</span><span begin="1:06.543" end="1:07.303">が</span><span begin="1:07.303" end="1:08.014">如</span><span begin="1:08.014" end="1:10.135">く</span><span begin="1:10.135" end="1:10.328">花</span><span begin="1:10.328" end="1:10.664">の</span><span begin="1:10.664" end="1:10.795">よ</span><span begin="1:10.795" end="1:10.925">う</span><span begin="1:10.925" end="1:11.636">に</span><span begin="1:11.636" end="1:12.226">は</span><span begin="1:12.226" end="1:12.544">か</span><span begin="1:12.544" end="1:12.941">な</span><span begin="1:12.941" end="1:13.295">い</span><span begin="1:13.295" end="1:14.399">命</span><span begin="1:14.399" end="1:15.895">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如路旁之石 在花一般短暂的生命面前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">roubou no ishi ga gotoku hana no you ni hakanai inochi ni</span></p><p begin="1:16.617" end="1:26.515" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.617" end="1:17.943">不</span><span begin="1:17.943" end="1:18.467">変</span><span begin="1:18.467" end="1:18.996">の</span><span begin="1:18.996" end="1:19.332">意</span><span begin="1:19.332" end="1:19.851">思</span><span begin="1:19.851" end="1:20.410">触</span><span begin="1:20.410" end="1:20.759">れ</span><span begin="1:20.759" end="1:21.427">る</span><span begin="1:21.427" end="1:21.867">も</span><span begin="1:21.867" end="1:22.233">の</span><span begin="1:22.233" end="1:22.744">そ</span><span begin="1:22.744" end="1:22.858">っ</span><span begin="1:22.858" end="1:23.338">と</span><span begin="1:23.338" end="1:23.669">お</span><span begin="1:23.669" end="1:24.220">し</span><span begin="1:24.220" end="1:25.294">止</span><span begin="1:25.294" end="1:25.455">め</span><span begin="1:25.455" end="1:26.515">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以不变的意志 将触及之物 轻轻挡住</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kawarazu no ishi fureru mono sotto oshitomete</span></p><p begin="1:27.998" end="1:33.332" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.998" end="1:28.461">咲</span><span begin="1:28.461" end="1:29.045">き</span><span begin="1:29.045" end="1:29.365">逝</span><span begin="1:29.365" end="1:29.919">く</span><span begin="1:29.919" end="1:30.472">も</span><span begin="1:30.472" end="1:30.856">の</span><span begin="1:30.856" end="1:31.292">見</span><span begin="1:31.292" end="1:31.877">送</span><span begin="1:31.877" end="1:32.214">っ</span><span begin="1:32.214" end="1:32.767">て</span><span begin="1:32.767" end="1:33.278">ま</span><span begin="1:33.278" end="1:33.332">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">目送那些绽放即逝的一切 再一次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sakiyuku mono miokutte mata</span></p><p begin="1:33.665" end="1:38.043" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.665" end="1:34.455">最</span><span begin="1:34.455" end="1:34.585">後</span><span begin="1:34.585" end="1:34.812">に</span><span begin="1:34.812" end="1:35.162">歌</span><span begin="1:35.162" end="1:35.817">う</span><span begin="1:35.817" end="1:36.170">孤</span><span begin="1:36.170" end="1:36.294">独</span><span begin="1:36.294" end="1:36.673">の</span><span begin="1:36.673" end="1:37.070">独</span><span begin="1:37.070" end="1:37.219">唱</span><span begin="1:37.219" end="1:38.043">曲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后所歌唱的 孤独的咏叹调</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saigo ni utau kodoku no aria</span></p><p begin="1:38.914" end="1:44.394" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.914" end="1:39.093">揺</span><span begin="1:39.093" end="1:39.271">ら</span><span begin="1:39.271" end="1:39.481">が</span><span begin="1:39.481" end="1:40.083">ぬ</span><span begin="1:40.083" end="1:41.935">心</span><span begin="1:41.935" end="1:42.079">さ</span><span begin="1:42.079" end="1:42.275">だ</span><span begin="1:42.275" end="1:42.624">め</span><span begin="1:42.624" end="1:42.991">の</span><span begin="1:42.991" end="1:43.327">ま</span><span begin="1:43.327" end="1:43.713">ま</span><span begin="1:43.713" end="1:44.394">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不动摇的心 循着宿命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yuraganu kokoro sadame no mama ni</span></p><p begin="1:44.783" end="1:50.106" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.783" end="1:45.119">一</span><span begin="1:45.119" end="1:45.813">度</span><span begin="1:45.813" end="1:46.904">守</span><span begin="1:46.904" end="1:47.052">ら</span><span begin="1:47.052" end="1:47.244">れ</span><span begin="1:47.244" end="1:47.925">ぬ</span><span begin="1:47.925" end="1:48.684">約</span><span begin="1:48.684" end="1:49.395">束</span><span begin="1:49.395" end="1:50.106">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那注定无法守住的约定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ichido mamorarenu yakusoku o</span></p><p begin="1:50.865" end="1:56.177" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.865" end="1:51.361">何</span><span begin="1:51.361" end="1:51.509">も</span><span begin="1:51.509" end="1:51.906">か</span><span begin="1:51.906" end="1:52.067">も</span><span begin="1:52.067" end="1:52.264">す</span><span begin="1:52.264" end="1:52.630">べ</span><span begin="1:52.630" end="1:52.997">て</span><span begin="1:52.997" end="1:53.346">が</span><span begin="1:53.346" end="1:53.507">い</span><span begin="1:53.507" end="1:53.734">つ</span><span begin="1:53.734" end="1:54.018">か</span><span begin="1:54.018" end="1:54.402">遠</span><span begin="1:54.402" end="1:54.676">ざ</span><span begin="1:54.676" end="1:54.903">か</span><span begin="1:54.903" end="1:55.034">っ</span><span begin="1:55.034" end="1:55.340">て</span><span begin="1:55.340" end="1:55.501">い</span><span begin="1:55.501" end="1:55.710">く</span><span begin="1:55.710" end="1:55.876">な</span><span begin="1:55.876" end="1:56.177">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若一切的一切 终将渐行渐远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani mo kamo subete ga itsuka toozakatte iku nara</span></p><p begin="1:56.598" end="2:01.563" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.598" end="1:56.903">は</span><span begin="1:56.903" end="1:57.082">じ</span><span begin="1:57.082" end="1:57.291">め</span><span begin="1:57.291" end="1:57.627">か</span><span begin="1:57.627" end="1:57.771">ら</span><span begin="1:57.771" end="1:57.968">そ</span><span begin="1:57.968" end="1:58.321">の</span><span begin="1:58.321" end="1:58.674">い</span><span begin="1:58.674" end="1:58.805">っ</span><span begin="1:58.805" end="1:59.110">そ</span><span begin="1:59.110" end="1:59.241">あ</span><span begin="1:59.241" end="1:59.427">あ</span><span begin="1:59.427" end="1:59.730">最</span><span begin="1:59.730" end="1:59.878">後</span><span begin="1:59.878" end="2:00.190">の</span><span begin="2:00.190" end="2:00.478">一</span><span begin="2:00.478" end="2:00.609">人</span><span begin="2:00.609" end="2:00.818">を</span><span begin="2:00.818" end="2:00.997">願</span><span begin="2:00.997" end="2:01.158">う</span><span begin="2:01.158" end="2:01.337">ま</span><span begin="2:01.337" end="2:01.563">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不如从一开始就索性——啊 直到祈愿成为最后的一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hajime kara sono isso aa saigo no hitori o negau made</span></p><p begin="2:02.286" end="2:08.682" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.286" end="2:03.704">独</span><span begin="2:03.704" end="2:04.415">り</span><span begin="2:04.415" end="2:05.157">き</span><span begin="2:05.157" end="2:07.059">り</span><span begin="2:07.059" end="2:07.238">砕</span><span begin="2:07.238" end="2:07.430">け</span><span begin="2:07.430" end="2:07.640">る</span><span begin="2:07.640" end="2:07.818">ま</span><span begin="2:07.818" end="2:08.682">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤身一人 直到碎裂为止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitorikiri kudakeru made</span></p><p begin="2:23.695" end="2:34.116" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.695" end="2:24.158">そ</span><span begin="2:24.158" end="2:24.770">の</span><span begin="2:24.770" end="2:24.918">手</span><span begin="2:24.918" end="2:25.128">を</span><span begin="2:25.128" end="2:25.590">伸</span><span begin="2:25.590" end="2:26.144">ば</span><span begin="2:26.144" end="2:26.576">し</span><span begin="2:26.576" end="2:27.077">契</span><span begin="2:27.077" end="2:27.635">り</span><span begin="2:27.635" end="2:27.974">を</span><span begin="2:27.974" end="2:28.463">結</span><span begin="2:28.463" end="2:28.882">ぶ</span><span begin="2:28.882" end="2:29.013">わ</span><span begin="2:29.013" end="2:29.223">れ</span><span begin="2:29.223" end="2:29.449">ら</span><span begin="2:29.449" end="2:29.917">と</span><span begin="2:29.917" end="2:30.283">わ</span><span begin="2:30.283" end="2:30.515">に</span><span begin="2:30.515" end="2:30.834">離</span><span begin="2:30.834" end="2:31.232">れ</span><span begin="2:31.232" end="2:31.896">は</span><span begin="2:31.896" end="2:32.061">し</span><span begin="2:32.061" end="2:32.271">な</span><span begin="2:32.271" end="2:32.746">い</span><span begin="2:32.746" end="2:34.116">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸出那只手 缔结盟誓——我们永远不会分离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono te o nobashi chigiri o musubu warera towa ni hanare wa shinai to</span></p><p begin="2:34.986" end="2:45.148" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.986" end="2:36.204">苔</span><span begin="2:36.204" end="2:36.533">の</span><span begin="2:36.533" end="2:36.995">一</span><span begin="2:36.995" end="2:38.002">片</span><span begin="2:38.002" end="2:38.478">む</span><span begin="2:38.478" end="2:39.098">す</span><span begin="2:39.098" end="2:39.242">ま</span><span begin="2:39.242" end="2:39.438">で</span><span begin="2:39.438" end="2:39.834">の</span><span begin="2:39.834" end="2:40.279">刹</span><span begin="2:40.279" end="2:40.549">那</span><span begin="2:40.549" end="2:40.824">と</span><span begin="2:40.824" end="2:41.342">か</span><span begin="2:41.342" end="2:41.743">く</span><span begin="2:41.743" end="2:41.892">も</span><span begin="2:41.892" end="2:42.084">あ</span><span begin="2:42.084" end="2:42.263">さ</span><span begin="2:42.263" end="2:42.678">は</span><span begin="2:42.678" end="2:43.163">か</span><span begin="2:43.163" end="2:43.642">な</span><span begin="2:43.642" end="2:44.214">永</span><span begin="2:44.214" end="2:45.148">遠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一片青苔初生的刹那 与如此浅薄的永远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">koke no hitokata musu made no setsuna to kaku mo asahaka na eien</span></p><p begin="2:45.845" end="2:56.583" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.845" end="2:46.024">果</span><span begin="2:46.024" end="2:46.216">た</span><span begin="2:46.216" end="2:46.408">さ</span><span begin="2:46.408" end="2:46.604">れ</span><span begin="2:46.604" end="2:47.267">ぬ</span><span begin="2:47.267" end="2:48.624">約</span><span begin="2:48.624" end="2:49.417">束</span><span begin="2:49.417" end="2:51.555">果</span><span begin="2:51.555" end="2:51.734">た</span><span begin="2:51.734" end="2:51.931">さ</span><span begin="2:51.931" end="2:52.279">れ</span><span begin="2:52.279" end="2:53.663">続</span><span begin="2:53.663" end="2:54.029">け</span><span begin="2:54.029" end="2:54.423">る</span><span begin="2:54.423" end="2:55.008">約</span><span begin="2:55.008" end="2:56.583">束</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法兑现的约定 持续被兑现的约定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hatasarenu yakusoku hatasaretsudzukeru yakusoku</span></p><p begin="2:57.955" end="3:07.955" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.955" end="2:58.871">不</span><span begin="2:58.871" end="2:59.993">交</span><span begin="2:59.993" end="3:00.520">の</span><span begin="3:00.520" end="3:00.853">意</span><span begin="3:00.853" end="3:01.321">思</span><span begin="3:01.321" end="3:01.943">そ</span><span begin="3:01.943" end="3:02.249">の</span><span begin="3:02.249" end="3:02.790">笑</span><span begin="3:02.790" end="3:03.327">み</span><span begin="3:03.327" end="3:03.693">か</span><span begin="3:03.693" end="3:04.265">ら</span><span begin="3:04.265" end="3:04.758">身</span><span begin="3:04.758" end="3:05.107">を</span><span begin="3:05.107" end="3:06.127">遠</span><span begin="3:06.127" end="3:06.651">ざ</span><span begin="3:06.651" end="3:06.896">け</span><span begin="3:06.896" end="3:07.955">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以不交契的意志 从那微笑中 抽身远离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kawasazu no ishi sono emi kara mi o toozakete</span></p><p begin="3:09.475" end="3:14.857" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.475" end="3:10.392">誰</span><span begin="3:10.392" end="3:11.294">一</span><span begin="3:11.294" end="3:11.913">人</span><span begin="3:11.913" end="3:12.262">い</span><span begin="3:12.262" end="3:12.786">な</span><span begin="3:12.786" end="3:13.296">い</span><span begin="3:13.296" end="3:13.652">世</span><span begin="3:13.652" end="3:14.678">界</span><span begin="3:14.678" end="3:14.857">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在空无一人的世界里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare hitori inai sekai de</span></p><p begin="3:15.114" end="3:19.742" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.114" end="3:15.843">最</span><span begin="3:15.843" end="3:15.991">後</span><span begin="3:15.991" end="3:16.231">に</span><span begin="3:16.231" end="3:16.615">歌</span><span begin="3:16.615" end="3:17.278">う</span><span begin="3:17.278" end="3:17.625">孤</span><span begin="3:17.625" end="3:17.756">独</span><span begin="3:17.756" end="3:17.948">の</span><span begin="3:17.948" end="3:18.489">独</span><span begin="3:18.489" end="3:18.620">唱</span><span begin="3:18.620" end="3:19.742">曲</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后所歌唱的 孤独的咏叹调</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saigo ni utau kodoku no aria</span></p><p begin="3:20.300" end="3:25.853" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.300" end="3:20.479">揺</span><span begin="3:20.479" end="3:20.658">ら</span><span begin="3:20.658" end="3:20.850">が</span><span begin="3:20.850" end="3:21.351">ぬ</span><span begin="3:21.351" end="3:23.331">心</span><span begin="3:23.331" end="3:23.511">惜</span><span begin="3:23.511" end="3:23.690">し</span><span begin="3:23.690" end="3:24.213">く</span><span begin="3:24.213" end="3:24.344">な</span><span begin="3:24.344" end="3:24.645">ど</span><span begin="3:24.645" end="3:25.077">な</span><span begin="3:25.077" end="3:25.853">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不动摇的心 绝无惋惜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yuraganu kokoro oshiku nado nai</span></p><p begin="3:26.268" end="3:31.874" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.268" end="3:26.559">新</span><span begin="3:26.559" end="3:27.173">た</span><span begin="3:27.173" end="3:27.590">に</span><span begin="3:27.590" end="3:28.254">約</span><span begin="3:28.254" end="3:28.620">束</span><span begin="3:28.620" end="3:29.410">を</span><span begin="3:29.410" end="3:30.060">遺</span><span begin="3:30.060" end="3:30.457">す</span><span begin="3:30.457" end="3:30.866">よ</span><span begin="3:30.866" end="3:31.874">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与其重新留下约定——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">arata ni yakusoku o nokosu yori</span></p><p begin="3:32.271" end="3:37.720" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.271" end="3:32.650">追</span><span begin="3:32.650" end="3:32.798">い</span><span begin="3:32.798" end="3:32.977">つ</span><span begin="3:32.977" end="3:33.343">か</span><span begin="3:33.343" end="3:33.502">れ</span><span begin="3:33.502" end="3:33.777">追</span><span begin="3:33.777" end="3:34.064">い</span><span begin="3:34.064" end="3:34.274">越</span><span begin="3:34.274" end="3:34.422">し</span><span begin="3:34.422" end="3:34.819">て</span><span begin="3:34.819" end="3:34.937">い</span><span begin="3:34.937" end="3:35.129">つ</span><span begin="3:35.129" end="3:35.496">か</span><span begin="3:35.496" end="3:35.644">そ</span><span begin="3:35.644" end="3:35.869">の</span><span begin="3:35.869" end="3:36.267">亡</span><span begin="3:36.267" end="3:36.855">骸</span><span begin="3:36.855" end="3:37.109">を</span><span begin="3:37.109" end="3:37.288">踏</span><span begin="3:37.288" end="3:37.720">む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被人追上又将其超越 终有一日踏过那些亡骸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oitsukare oikoshite itsuka sono nakigara o fumu</span></p><p begin="3:37.986" end="3:43.364" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:37.986" end="3:38.321">果</span><span begin="3:38.321" end="3:38.500">て</span><span begin="3:38.500" end="3:38.697">し</span><span begin="3:38.697" end="3:39.094">な</span><span begin="3:39.094" end="3:39.129">く</span><span begin="3:39.129" end="3:39.260">繰</span><span begin="3:39.260" end="3:39.431">り</span><span begin="3:39.431" end="3:40.064">返</span><span begin="3:40.064" end="3:40.460">す</span><span begin="3:40.460" end="3:40.609">そ</span><span begin="3:40.609" end="3:40.801">う</span><span begin="3:40.801" end="3:41.185">最</span><span begin="3:41.185" end="3:41.400">後</span><span begin="3:41.400" end="3:41.575">の</span><span begin="3:41.575" end="3:41.898">一</span><span begin="3:41.898" end="3:42.072">人</span><span begin="3:42.072" end="3:42.238">と</span><span begin="3:42.238" end="3:42.321">成</span><span begin="3:42.321" end="3:42.674">れ</span><span begin="3:42.674" end="3:42.818">る</span><span begin="3:42.818" end="3:42.998">ま</span><span begin="3:42.998" end="3:43.364">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽地反复 是的——直到成为最后的一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hateshi naku kurikaesu sou saigo no hitori to nareru made</span></p><p begin="3:43.716" end="3:49.398" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:43.716" end="3:44.376">そ</span><span begin="3:44.376" end="3:45.156">れ</span><span begin="3:45.156" end="3:45.856">で</span><span begin="3:45.856" end="3:46.567">な</span><span begin="3:46.567" end="3:48.221">お</span><span begin="3:48.221" end="3:48.400">う</span><span begin="3:48.400" end="3:48.548">ず</span><span begin="3:48.548" end="3:48.727">く</span><span begin="3:48.727" end="3:49.263">思</span><span begin="3:49.263" end="3:49.398">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 仍在隐隐作痛的心绪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sorede nao uzuku omoi</span></p><p begin="3:49.467" end="3:57.594" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:49.467" end="3:50.130">だ</span><span begin="3:50.130" end="3:50.842">れ</span><span begin="3:50.842" end="3:51.553">ひ</span><span begin="3:51.553" end="3:52.312">と</span><span begin="3:52.312" end="3:53.669">り</span><span begin="3:53.669" end="3:54.266">傍</span><span begin="3:54.266" end="3:54.465">に</span><span begin="3:54.465" end="3:54.662">寄</span><span begin="3:54.662" end="3:54.914">せ</span><span begin="3:54.914" end="3:55.124">ず</span><span begin="3:55.124" end="3:55.477">に</span><span begin="3:55.477" end="3:55.687">生</span><span begin="3:55.687" end="3:55.866">き</span><span begin="3:55.866" end="3:56.438">て</span><span begin="3:56.438" end="3:56.612">ひ</span><span begin="3:56.612" end="3:56.808">び</span><span begin="3:56.808" end="3:57.096">割</span><span begin="3:57.096" end="3:57.258">れ</span><span begin="3:57.258" end="3:57.594">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不让任何人靠近地活着 逐渐龟裂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare hitori soba ni yosezu ni ikite hibiwarete</span></p><p begin="3:57.875" end="4:01.558" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:57.875" end="3:58.024">い</span><span begin="3:58.024" end="3:58.329">つ</span><span begin="3:58.329" end="3:58.582">か</span><span begin="3:58.582" end="3:58.748">だ</span><span begin="3:58.748" end="3:59.084">れ</span><span begin="3:59.084" end="3:59.276">か</span><span begin="3:59.276" end="3:59.743">を</span><span begin="3:59.743" end="4:00.110">望</span><span begin="4:00.110" end="4:00.476">む</span><span begin="4:00.476" end="4:00.812">な</span><span begin="4:00.812" end="4:01.558">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一日竟渴望某人——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsuka dareka o nozomu nado</span></p><p begin="4:01.312" end="4:05.865" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:01.312" end="4:01.456">—</span><span begin="4:01.456" end="4:01.574">—</span><span begin="4:01.574" end="4:01.738">ど</span><span begin="4:01.738" end="4:02.087">う</span><span begin="4:02.087" end="4:02.280">し</span><span begin="4:02.280" end="4:03.190">て</span><span begin="4:03.190" end="4:03.321">果</span><span begin="4:03.321" end="4:03.499">た</span><span begin="4:03.499" end="4:03.678">さ</span><span begin="4:03.678" end="4:03.875">れ</span><span begin="4:03.875" end="4:04.075">ぬ</span><span begin="4:04.075" end="4:04.629">約</span><span begin="4:04.629" end="4:05.058">束</span><span begin="4:05.058" end="4:05.865">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">——为何还要许下无法兑现的约定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">——doushite hatasarenu yakusoku o</span></p><p begin="4:06.182" end="4:11.344" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:06.182" end="4:06.255">揺</span><span begin="4:06.255" end="4:06.369">ら</span><span begin="4:06.369" end="4:06.548">が</span><span begin="4:06.548" end="4:07.118">ぬ</span><span begin="4:07.118" end="4:09.064">心</span><span begin="4:09.064" end="4:09.199">な</span><span begin="4:09.199" end="4:09.391">ぜ</span><span begin="4:09.391" end="4:09.953">望</span><span begin="4:09.953" end="4:10.320">め</span><span begin="4:10.320" end="4:10.482">る</span><span begin="4:10.482" end="4:10.756">だ</span><span begin="4:10.756" end="4:10.943">ろ</span><span begin="4:10.943" end="4:11.344">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不动摇的心 为何还会去奢望呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yuraganu kokoro naze nozomeru darou</span></p><p begin="4:11.928" end="4:17.226" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:11.928" end="4:12.089">う</span><span begin="4:12.089" end="4:12.304">つ</span><span begin="4:12.304" end="4:12.434">ろ</span><span begin="4:12.434" end="4:12.831">う</span><span begin="4:12.831" end="4:13.355">も</span><span begin="4:13.355" end="4:13.686">の</span><span begin="4:13.686" end="4:14.034">の</span><span begin="4:14.034" end="4:14.151">よ</span><span begin="4:14.151" end="4:14.391">う</span><span begin="4:14.391" end="4:15.120">に</span><span begin="4:15.120" end="4:15.843">生</span><span begin="4:15.843" end="4:16.179">き</span><span begin="4:16.179" end="4:16.546">る</span><span begin="4:16.546" end="4:17.226">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若如那无常之物一般活着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">utsurou mono no you ni ikiru to</span></p><p begin="4:17.979" end="4:23.348" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:17.979" end="4:18.516">誰</span><span begin="4:18.516" end="4:18.665">を</span><span begin="4:18.665" end="4:18.831">か</span><span begin="4:18.831" end="4:19.190">も</span><span begin="4:19.190" end="4:19.387">逝</span><span begin="4:19.387" end="4:19.754">く</span><span begin="4:19.754" end="4:20.102">人</span><span begin="4:20.102" end="4:20.500">に</span><span begin="4:20.500" end="4:20.617">わ</span><span begin="4:20.617" end="4:20.810">け</span><span begin="4:20.810" end="4:21.163">な</span><span begin="4:21.163" end="4:21.324">く</span><span begin="4:21.324" end="4:21.503">つ</span><span begin="4:21.503" end="4:21.805">た</span><span begin="4:21.805" end="4:22.062">う</span><span begin="4:22.062" end="4:22.208">そ</span><span begin="4:22.208" end="4:22.471">の</span><span begin="4:22.471" end="4:23.348">涙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为每一位逝者 无端流下的那行泪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare o ka mo yuku hito ni wakenaku tsutau sono namida</span></p><p begin="4:23.696" end="4:32.111" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:23.696" end="4:24.049">こ</span><span begin="4:24.049" end="4:24.180">こ</span><span begin="4:24.180" end="4:24.390">ろ</span><span begin="4:24.390" end="4:24.774">を</span><span begin="4:24.774" end="4:25.110">穿</span><span begin="4:25.110" end="4:25.489">つ</span><span begin="4:25.489" end="4:25.842">な</span><span begin="4:25.842" end="4:26.257">ら</span><span begin="4:26.257" end="4:26.401">ま</span><span begin="4:26.401" end="4:26.590">だ</span><span begin="4:26.590" end="4:26.848">最</span><span begin="4:26.848" end="4:27.044">後</span><span begin="4:27.044" end="4:27.302">の</span><span begin="4:27.302" end="4:27.464">一</span><span begin="4:27.464" end="4:27.643">人</span><span begin="4:27.643" end="4:27.934">に</span><span begin="4:27.934" end="4:28.048">慣</span><span begin="4:28.048" end="4:28.244">れ</span><span begin="4:28.244" end="4:28.517">る</span><span begin="4:28.517" end="4:28.730">ま</span><span begin="4:28.730" end="4:31.793">で</span><span begin="4:31.793" end="4:32.020">…</span><span begin="4:32.020" end="4:32.111">…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若穿透了心——那就等到习惯做那最后的一人为止……</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokoro o ugatsu nara mada saigo no hitori ni nareru made. . . . . .</span></p><p begin="4:49.467" end="4:55.946" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:49.467" end="4:49.646">あ</span><span begin="4:49.646" end="4:49.824">あ</span><span begin="4:49.824" end="4:49.986">さ</span><span begin="4:49.986" end="4:50.212">い</span><span begin="4:50.212" end="4:50.392">ご</span><span begin="4:50.392" end="4:50.601">の</span><span begin="4:50.601" end="4:50.780">ひ</span><span begin="4:50.780" end="4:50.942">と</span><span begin="4:50.942" end="4:51.182">り</span><span begin="4:51.182" end="4:51.445">に</span><span begin="4:51.445" end="4:51.795">な</span><span begin="4:51.795" end="4:52.239">れ</span><span begin="4:52.239" end="4:52.750">る</span><span begin="4:52.750" end="4:53.201">ま</span><span begin="4:53.201" end="4:55.780">で</span><span begin="4:55.780" end="4:55.881">…</span><span begin="4:55.881" end="4:55.946">…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊——直到终能甘为那最后的一人……</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aa saigo no hitori ni nareru made. . . . . .</span></p></div></body></tt>